  "_comment": [
    "Hand-curated short names, mapped to the generated icon id they point at.",
    "The generator already derives two names for every icon: the short form",
    "(lambda) and the vendor-faithful form (aws-lambda, amazon-ec2). This file",
    "covers the names people actually say out loud but that appear nowhere in",
    "the AWS filenames: acronyms (s3, sqs, iam) and colloquial short forms",
    "(beanstalk, firehose, route53).",
    "",
    "Any entry whose target does not exist is reported at build time and",
    "skipped, so this file degrades safely across AWS asset-package releases."
